---
---

<section class="title-sponsor-intro series-manifesto" aria-labelledby="series-manifesto-heading">
	<div class="title-sponsor-intro-shell">
		<div class="title-sponsor-intro-media title-sponsor-intro-media--banner">
			<img
				class="title-sponsor-team-photo"
				src="/images/stops/ocala-spotlight.webp"
				alt="Racquetball action at a Florida Grand Prix stop"
				width="1600"
				height="900"
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
			/>
			<div class="title-sponsor-banner-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			<div class="title-sponsor-banner-content">
				<div class="title-sponsor-hero-row title-sponsor-hero-row--overlay">
					<a
						class="title-sponsor-logo-link"
						href="/"
						aria-label="Florida Racquetball Grand Prix"
					>
						<img
							class="title-sponsor-logo"
							src="/images/series-logo.webp"
							alt=""
							width="256"
							height="256"
							decoding="async"
						/>
					</a>
					<div class="title-sponsor-hero-text">
						<p class="title-sponsor-kicker">Season 1 · 2026</p>
						<h2 id="series-manifesto-heading" class="title-sponsor-name">
							Florida <span class="title-sponsor-name-light">Racquetball Grand Prix</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="title-sponsor-intro-body">
			<blockquote class="series-manifesto-quote">
				<p>
					&ldquo;Four stops. One leaderboard. The first statewide racquetball Grand Prix Florida has
					ever seen.&rdquo;
				</p>
			</blockquote>

			<p class="title-sponsor-thanks">
				This is not a one-weekend tournament. It is a season-long chase across the state: points
				earned at every stop, standings that move after every final, and a title that rewards the players
				who show up and keep climbing.
			</p>

			<div class="title-sponsor-mv-grid">
				<div class="title-sponsor-mv-card">
					<h3 class="title-sponsor-mv-label">The chase</h3>
					<p class="title-sponsor-mv-text">
						From Ocala in May to outdoor Eustis in December, every finish feeds one statewide board.
						Consistency wins. Deep runs matter. The season does not reset until the last ball is put away.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="title-sponsor-mv-card">
					<h3 class="title-sponsor-mv-label">The stage</h3>
					<p class="title-sponsor-mv-text">
						Four host cities. Full brackets. Real crowds. A series built to raise the level of Florida
						racquetball, and give every division a clear path to the top of the Grand Prix standings.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="title-sponsor-actions">
				<a class="title-sponsor-cta title-sponsor-cta-primary" href="/leaderboard">
					View standings →
				</a>
				<a class="title-sponsor-cta" href="/tournaments">See the schedule →</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
